 S4 --> S5
 S6["6. Verify effectiveness and close\nConfirm remediation, residual risk, evidence quality, authority, and next review."]
 S5 --> S6
 S7["7. Convert findings into organizational learning\nUpdate standards, training, design, procurement, and portfolio governance."]
